{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2023-06-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'BRANCHOUT FOOD INC.: RECEIVES COMMITMENT FROM COSTCO TO LAUNCH NEW SNACK PRODUCT', 'text': 'BEND, ORE. , JUNE 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BRANCHOUT FOOD INC., (NASDAQ: BOF) A LEADING PROVIDER OF HIGH-QUALITY DEHYDRATED FRUIT AND VEGETABLE PRODUCTS, IS EXCITED TO ANNOUNCE A NEW COMMITMENT FROM COSTCO (NASDAQ: COST) IN THE LOS ANGELES REGION. THE LOS ANGELES REGION COMMITMENT IS BUILT ON A HISTORY OF SUCCESS WITH COSTCO AS IT MARKS THE THIRD PRODUCT AND FOURTH COSTCO REGION THAT BRANCHOUT FOOD HAS RECENTLY SOLD PRODUCTS INTO INCLUDING, PACIFIC NORTHWEST, NORTHERN CALIFORNIA, AND TEXAS.'}